# CR 720 through Enter the Dungeon: a whole subgame plays out inside the
# spell's resolution (SubgameEffect.java), each player starting at 5 life and
# using a copy of their library as their deck. Human goes first; ai's library
# is empty, so ai loses on its first subgame draw (CR 704.5b) and human wins.
# RememberPlayers$ Win remembers human, who then searches the main game's
# library -- untouched by the subgame, which played copies -- for two cards.
# Life totals are the main game's own throughout.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
# The subgame's own start: the starting player, then each seat keeps.
queue startingplayer human
queue keephand true
queue keephand true
# The winner's search, after the subgame.
queue cardchoice 4,6
castspell human 1
resolvestack
